    "contenu": {
      "_type": "localeRichText",
      "fr": [
        {
          "_key": "5747e84cd2e0",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "2e5c14cf0107",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Le terme "
            },
            {
              "_key": "af7854bc03ff",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "cépage"
            },
            {
              "_key": "4a4efd8245ec",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " revient souvent dans l’univers du vin et du champagne. Mais que signifie-t-il vraiment ? Comprendre cette notion est essentiel pour mieux apprécier les vins, leur origine, et la richesse du vignoble champenois, de la Côte des Bar à Montgueux."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9baf3a9f7fdc",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "324ff36172b0",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dans le monde, on recense plus de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "5e2d8422c199",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "10 000 cépages"
            },
            {
              "_key": "1cc54bbfe743",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " différents , mais en réalité, seule une partie est largement cultivée."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "715762db7fde",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "a0755b69e767",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "L’Organisation Internationale de la Vigne et du Vin (OIV) estime qu’environ "
            },
            {
              "_key": "c9fa3e8e45c4",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "1 300 cépages"
            },
            {
              "_key": "b618939879d0",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sont exploités de manière significative pour la production de vin."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c3decd2323bc",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "21a57eea44d8",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Parmi eux, une cinquantaine représentent à elles seules "
            },
            {
              "_key": "fdcef90eb7f5",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "90 % de la production mondiale"
            },
            {
              "_key": "4c5d164d5eb3",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " : des grands classiques comme le Cabernet Sauvignon, le Merlot, le Chardonnay, le Pinot Noir, ou encore la Syrah."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ee28292a2af4",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "93ee70290ba6",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En Champagne, le choix est encore plus restreint : seulement "
            },
            {
              "_key": "85a0d82dd951",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "7 cépages"
            },
            {
              "_key": "a516e9a4f21c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sont autorisés."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "53378fbc00c6",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "d7ee113385d1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En résumé, la nature offre une immense diversité, mais au verre, on retrouve surtout une poignée de cépages bien connus."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "302323513a6e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "fa874cd9bebf",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Définition d’un cépage"
